### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### Get one incident by incident_id
### -----------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents/{{incidentId}}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### List incidents (default pagination)
### -----------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents

### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### List incidents with pagination
### -----------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?skip=0&limit=10

### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### List incidents filtered by decision and stream
### -----------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?decision=none&stream_name=fusion

### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### List incidents by time window (ISO timestamps)
### -----------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents?from_ts=2026-04-03T00:00:00Z&to_ts=2026-04-06T00:00:00Z

### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### Idempotency check: same incident_id returns existing record
### -----------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "incident_id": "{{incidentId}}",
  "has_drone": true,
  "fused_confidence": 0.9,
  "confidence_band": "high",
  "decision": "drone",
  "evidence": {
    "rgb": null,
    "thermal": null
  },
  "per_modality_scores": {
    "rgb": 0.0,
    "thermal": 0.0
  },
  "thresholds": {
    "alert": 0.75,
    "hold": 0.55
  },
  "gating_reason": "test-idempotency",
  "latency_ms": 0.01,
  "media": {
    "rgb": null,
    "thermal": null
  },
  "objects": [],
  "timestamp": 1775329453.026127
}

